# Coverage / reports. Anchored to the repo root on purpose: unanchored,
# `reports/` matches at any depth and silently swallowed
# `frontend/src/reports/`, which is source.
/reports/

# What `just shot` writes. Pictures of a moment, not of the code — they go
# stale the next time a screen changes, and a committed one would be read as
# though it still described the app.
.screenshots/

